---
// BioCodeCTA.astro
---

<section class="bc-cta">
  <div class="bc-cta-glow"></div>
  <div class="bc-cta-inner">
    <div class="bc-cta-tag">Your Journey Starts Here</div>
    <h2 class="bc-cta-heading">
      Do You Know Your<br />
      <em>Biocodes®</em> Yet?
    </h2>
    <p class="bc-cta-sub">
      Relentless inner-strength and optimism aren't born — they're built.<br />
      It's time to discover the code that makes you unshakable.
    </p>
    <a href="/contact-us" class="bc-cta-btn">
      Make it Happen
      <span class="bc-cta-btn-arrow">→</span>
    </a>
    <p class="bc-cta-note">No fluff. No excuses. Just results.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bc-cta {
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    padding: 100px 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .bc-cta-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 600px;
    height: 300px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse,
      rgba(201, 151, 58, 0.07) 0%,
      transparent 70%
    );
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .bc-cta::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    top: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      transparent,
      rgba(201, 151, 58, 0.4),
      transparent
    );
  }

  .bc-cta-inner {
    position: relative;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .bc-cta-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: "Barlow Condensed", sans-serif;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .bc-cta-tag::before,
  .bc-cta-tag::after {
    content: "";
    display: block;
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .bc-cta-heading {
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5.5vw, 58px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .bc-cta-heading em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--gold-light);
  }

  .bc-cta-sub {
    font-family: "Barlow Condensed", sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 48px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .bc-cta-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: "Barlow Condensed", sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--gold);
    padding: 16px 40px;
    position: relative;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background 0.2s,
      transform 0.15s;
    clip-path: polygon(12px 0%, 100% 0%, calc(100% - 12px) 100%, 0% 100%);
  }
  .bc-cta-btn:hover {
    background: var(--gold-light);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .bc-cta-btn:active {
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
  .bc-cta-btn-arrow {
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  .bc-cta-btn:hover .bc-cta-btn-arrow {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .bc-cta-note {
    margin-top: 22px;
    font-family: "Barlow Condensed", sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--muted);
    opacity: 0.6;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
</style>
